OL,3,AUber to cut over 3,000 jobs in major
OL,4,Aglobal restructuring
OL,5,
OL,6,FUber is cutting more than 3,000 jobs
OL,7,Fworldwide as part of a major overhaul
OL,8,Fdesigned to shrink management layers
OL,9,Fand refocus spending on its core
OL,10,Fbusiness.
OL,12,FThe cuts amount to roughly 10% of its
OL,13,Fglobal workforce, bringing staffing
OL,14,Fback to levels last seen in 2021.
OL,16,FChief executive Dara Khosrowshahi told
OL,17,Fstaff in a company email that the taxi
OL,18,Fand delivery firm had expanded quickly
OL,19,Fbut accumulated too many layers and
OL,20,Fsmall teams that slowed
OL,21,Fdecisionb@Qmaking.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
